.TH TDEPACKAGEKIT 1 "2026-11-05" "tdepackagekit 0.1.0" "Trinity Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
tdepackagekit \- install, remove and update software on the Trinity desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tdepackagekit
.RB [ \-\-updates ]
.RB [ \-\-settings ]
.RB [ \-\-install\-file
.IR file ]...
.RI [ "Trinity and TQt options" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tdepackagekit
(Software Management) is a graphical package manager for the Trinity Desktop
Environment. It talks to the PackageKit service, so it works on the same
package database as
.BR apt (8)
and the other package tools on the system.
.PP
One window has four pages:
.TP
.B Browse
Search for packages by name, description or file name, or by category, and
tick packages to install or untick them to remove.
.TP
.B Updates
Review available updates, grouped by severity, with changelogs and security
advisories.
.TP
.B History
See past installs, removals and updates, and whether they worked.
.TP
.B Repositories
Turn software repositories on or off.
.PP
Ticking a package only queues the change. Nothing is changed until
.B Apply
is pressed. The program then works out the full set of changes, asks for
confirmation if other packages are affected, and asks for a password through
the polkit authentication agent.
.PP
When
.B apt\-config\-icons
or
.B apt\-config\-icons\-large
is installed, the package lists show each application's icon from the
repositories' AppStream data.
.PP
Only one copy runs at a time. If it is already running, the options below act
on the open window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-updates
Open the Updates page.
.TP
.B \-\-settings
Open the settings dialog.
.TP
.BI \-\-install\-file " file"
Install the package file
.IR file ,
for example a
.I .deb
file. It can be given more than once. Local files can't be verified, so a
warning is shown before anything is installed.
.TP
.B \-\-help
List the options, including the generic Trinity and TQt ones
.RB ( \-\-help\-all ).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.trinity/share/config/tdepackagekitrc
Settings shared with
.BR tdepackagekit\-notifier (1).
.TP
.I /var/lib/swcatalog/icons/
.TQ
.I /var/lib/app\-info/icons/
AppStream icons, as unpacked by
.B apt\-config\-icons
and the AppStream apt hook.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TDEPK_APPSTREAM_ICON_DIRS
A colon-separated list of directories to look for AppStream icons in,
instead of the standard ones. Meant for testing.
.SH NOTES
Changing software needs a running polkit agent, normally from the
.B polkit\-agent\-tde
package. Without one, changes fail with a \(lqnot authorized\(rq error.
.PP
The full handbook is available in KHelpCenter, from
.B Help \(-> Software Management Handbook
or at
.IR help:/tdepackagekit .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tdepackagekit\-notifier (1),
.BR pkcon (1),
.BR apt (8),
.BR khelpcenter (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/Yjlion/tde-packagekit/issues.
